START
Display "Starting Concurrent Counter Program"
Create a variable called threadOneFinished and set it to FALSE
Create Thread 1
FOR counter from 1 to 20
    Display the counter value
    Pause briefly
END FOR

Display "Thread 1 reached 20"

Set threadOneFinished to TRUE

Notify Thread 2 that Thread 1 is finished
END Thread 1
Create Thread 2
Wait until threadOneFinished is TRUE

Display "Thread 2 starting countdown"

FOR counter from 20 down to 0
    Display the counter value
    Pause briefly
END FOR
END Thread 2
Start Thread 1
Start Thread 2
Wait for Thread 1 to finish
Wait for Thread 2 to finish
Display "Both threads have completed"
END
